it they're like  working on it's not enough time is  literally running out time's running out  i was running i gotta get on it i was  relieved during your piece i checked the  toilet paper that i use at home it's  called plant paper it uses bamboo that's  a new thing bamboo right and innovation  tony you're doing your points want to go  around the table and endorse our various  paper products i love that they're  speaking up though anna what are other  family members saying i was wondering  what you know they had they had these  descendants sign on as you saw like some  90 it's actually 96 descendants who  signed on everybody from grandfathers  all the way down and there's actually a  tradition their dad spoke up about some  png practices i think was back in the  70s wow so you know there's you know  they're not all going public but these  two decided to take this step which is a  big step forward for that yeah anna  thank you very much

